WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Zann's mind whirled as he finally got up to follow Venna.

2
00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:08.040
For a moment he thought he'd lost her—he couldn't hear or see her anywhere.

3
00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:11.587
Then he heard the soft clang of the airship door opening.

4
00:00:11.588 --> 00:00:15.369
As he neared the airship, Zann saw that the door was standing open.

5
00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:19.955
He crept closer and peered in. Venna was inside with her back to him.

6
00:00:19.956 --> 00:00:23.394
She was pulling things out of a box. The relics!

7
00:00:23.395 --> 00:00:26.683
Zann watched as Venna gathered them into a large sack.

8
00:00:26.684 --> 00:00:33.898
