10
00:00:36.575 --> 00:00:43.077
"Wow," he whispered. His teachers said the Horn alone held enough power to control all of Magica!

11
00:00:43.078 --> 00:00:47.340
Venna slung the sack over her shoulder and then hurried toward the Cave.

12
00:00:47.341 --> 00:00:53.292
Zann wasn't sure what to do. It seemed Venna was planning to take the relics through the wormhole herself.

13
00:00:53.293 --> 00:00:56.546
If Zann followed her, she'd lead him to the wormhole.

14
00:00:56.547 --> 00:00:59.934
He could hide until she went through it and then jump through.

15
00:00:59.935 --> 00:01:02.909
He'd be on his way to search for his parents within minutes.

16
00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:08.409
But if he did that, he wouldn't have time to leave a message for Boz or his friends about Venna's plan.

17
00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:15.155
